          "name": "open_service_case_flow",
          "description": "Hand a request that a person must decide to the right team. request_type is return_to_service (return-to-service sign-off, including closing an AOG), ad_compliance (airworthiness directive compliance), mel_deferral (deferring an item under the MEL), grounding_change (grounding or ungrounding an aircraft) or reliability_review (a repeat defect; agent_brief = the repeat-defect agent's flag). summary is a neutral 1-3 sentence summary in the controller's own words. The system routes it and returns OPENED with case_id, team and reply time, EXISTING, or BLOCKED / INVALID_TYPE with a reason. The assistant never signs off, defers, grounds or releases an aircraft and never promises or predicts the outcome. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
          "schemas": {
            "output": {
              "arguments": "schema://open_service_case_Args"
            },
            "reply": {
              "response": "schema://ToolResponse"
            }
          }
        },
