    {
      "id": "flow:propose_dispatch_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "propose_dispatch_flow",
        "description": "Step 1 of 2 to dispatch a technician to a work order at your base. Pass the wo_number and the tech_id from get_technicians (a full name also works). The system checks that the work order is open and unassigned, that the technician is at your base, holds the certification the job requires and a type rating for that aircraft, and is AVAILABLE, and returns PROPOSED with a proposal_id and a summary (expires in 15 minutes), or BLOCKED with reason_code NOT_CERTIFIED, TECH_UNAVAILABLE, WRONG_BASE, ALREADY_ASSIGNED, WO_CLOSED, TECH_NOT_FOUND or NOT_FOUND and a reason_text. Nobody is dispatched until confirm_action is called after the controller explicitly says yes. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
        "links": [
          {
            "id": 1,
            "from": "StartActivity",
            "to": "GuardedWrite",
            "type": "label",
