        "name": "confirm_action_flow",
        "description": "Step 2 of 2: carry out a part order or a dispatch the controller has explicitly confirmed. Pass the proposal_id from propose_part_order or propose_dispatch. The system re-checks every rule and returns EXECUTED with a reference (order PO-2026-0101 or dispatch NVA-DSP-000101), MANAGER_APPROVAL with a case_id (spend above the controller&#39;s limit: nothing is ordered until a maintenance manager approves), or BLOCKED / EXPIRED (after 15 minutes) / NOT_FOUND / ALREADY_DONE with the reason. Only call after the controller says yes to the exact proposal. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
