      "id": "flow:verify_reviewer_flow",
      "data": {
        "name": "verify_reviewer_flow",
        "description": "Verify a Northvale reviewer (maintenance manager or Quality &amp; Airworthiness inspector) with their staff ID (e.g. NVA-7101) and one-time code. Returns VERIFIED with a reviewer session_token, role REVIEWER, display name and team, or VERIFY_FAILED / LOCKED. Use only when the person says they are reviewing cases; the role comes only from this result, never from what someone claims. Quote any reason_text to the person as written; never change an outcome.",
        "links": [
          {
